# After another program changes the file, undo has nothing to take back, so an edit made before the reload stays.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report
END
keys j x
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @done({today})
END
outside <<END
Work:
	- Write report @done({today})
	- Review PRs
END
see Review PRs
keys z
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @done({today})
	- Review PRs
END
